  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: June 29, 2026</p>

  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Corriston Consulting ("we," "us," or "our"), operating the brand Website Support Studio ("WSS"), collects, uses, and shares information when you visit our websites or use our services.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Information you provide:</strong> when you contact us, request a quote, or purchase, we collect information such as your name, email address, phone number, business name, and the content and materials you share with us.</p>
  <p><strong>Payment information:</strong> payments are processed by Stripe. We do not collect or store your full card number; Stripe handles payment details under its own privacy and security practices. We receive limited transaction information such as confirmation, amount, and the last four digits of the card.</p>
  <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> when you visit our sites, we and our providers may collect device and usage data such as IP address, browser type, pages viewed, and referring URLs, including through cookies and similar technologies.</p>

  <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
  <p>We use information to provide and improve our services, process payments, respond to inquiries, deliver the website and content we build for you, operate and attribute our referral and affiliate program, send service-related and (with your consent where required) marketing communications, prevent fraud, and comply with legal obligations.</p>

  <h2>3. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
  <p>We use cookies and similar technologies for site functionality, analytics, and to attribute referrals in our affiliate program (for example, to credit the affiliate who referred you). You can control cookies through your browser settings; disabling some cookies may affect site functionality.</p>

  <h2>4. Service Providers We Share With</h2>
  <p>We share information with third-party providers that help us operate, including: <strong>Stripe</strong> (payment processing), our <strong>website hosting provider</strong>, our <strong>email and communications tools</strong>, <strong>analytics providers</strong>, and, when active, our <strong>affiliate-tracking platform</strong>. These providers process information on our behalf and are bound to protect it.</p>

  <h2>5. We Do Not Sell Your Personal Information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information for money. We may share data with service providers as described above and as required by law. If we ever engage in activity considered a "sale" or "sharing" for targeted advertising under applicable law, we will provide the required notices and opt-out options.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain information for as long as needed to provide the services, maintain business records, resolve disputes, and comply with legal obligations, after which we delete or anonymize it.</p>

  <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or obtain a copy of your personal information, and to opt out of certain processing. California residents have rights under the CCPA/CPRA, including the right to know, delete, correct, and opt out, and not to be discriminated against for exercising them. If you are in a jurisdiction with similar laws (such as the EU/UK), additional rights may apply. To exercise any right, contact us using the details below.</p>

  <h2>8. Security</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

  <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our services are intended for businesses and are not directed to children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 16.</p>

  <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Policy from time to time. Changes are effective when posted, and the "Last updated" date above will reflect the most recent revision.</p>

  <h2>11. Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions or to exercise your rights, contact Corriston Consulting at <a href="mailto:gary.corriston@gmail.com">gary.corriston@gmail.com</a>.</p>

